# What the source distribution carries beyond the code.
#
# The package data — assets/, the scaffold and the locale packs — is already
# declared in pyproject.toml under [tool.setuptools.package-data], and the
# sdist picks it up from there; verify with:
#
#     python -m build
#     tar tzf dist/mela_letterhead-*.tar.gz | grep -E 'assets|locales'
#
# This file is only for the things that live outside the package and would
# otherwise be left out. A changelog is the first thing a distribution
# packager looks for in an sdist, and the licence is the second.
include CHANGELOG.md
include LICENSE
